Sign In Register Sign In Register Request Demo Indonesian FMCG Brands E-commerce Companion Leading E-commerce Data Provider and Business Analysis Company Compas.co.id is a leading e-commerce data provider and business analysis company. We serve as a ‘Companion’ for Top Indonesia’s FMCG Brands, empowering their online businesses strategy and decision-making with accurate and actionable data-driven business insights. Request Demo 
Our Services  Stop Drowning in DataStart Making Waves! Compas.co.id Market Insight gather all the essential e-commerce insights you need, from market trends and competitor benchmarking. See How Market Insights Can Drive Your Brand Forward  Struggling to Read Data?We Simplify It for You! We transform complex data into clear, concise visuals that make it easy to spot trends, identify opportunities, and make informed decisions. Unlock the Power of Data-Driven Strategies  Actionable Insight Based On Data Our expert analysts provide the actionable insights you need to take your FMCG brand to the next level. See How Data Can Elevate Your Brand Strategy Compas.co.id by Numbers Market Insight Transforms raw data into powerful insights, helping brands navigate Indonesia’s dynamic e-commerce landscape with confidence and precision. Number of Clients Clients 2 + Satisfied Clients Retained 3 % Number of FMCG Brands Brands > 1 k Trusted by the Best in FMCG What Our Clients Have To Say “Dengan Compas.co.id, kami jadi lebih teredukasi dalam pengembangan produk atau kategori baru dan memperluas jangkauan ke retailer baru, berdasarkan data real time yang akurat.” Ferdiano PradiptaHead of E-Commerce and Digital SOHO Global Health  “Pelayanan dari tim Compas.co.id sangat baik, cepat, dan responsif, membantu kami dalam pengambilan keputusan strategis di e-commerce.” Wentra HakamiE-Commerce Channel Manager Danone  “Compas.co.id memberikan kami wawasan yang sangat berharga tentang performa brand kami di e-commerce, dengan data yang akurat dan mudah diakses secara berkala.” Rheisya Audry PutriE-Commerce Officer PT Bintang Toedjoe  “Dengan Compas.co.id, kami jadi lebih teredukasi dalam pengembangan produk atau kategori baru dan memperluas jangkauan ke retailer baru, berdasarkan data real time yang akurat.” Ferdiano PradiptaHead of E-Commerce and Digital SOHO Global Health  “Pelayanan dari tim Compas.co.id sangat baik, cepat, dan responsif, membantu kami dalam pengambilan keputusan strategis di e-commerce.” Wentra HakamiE-Commerce Channel Manager Danone  Meet our Partner From Trusted Brands We are proud to collaborate with Indonesia’s leading FMCG brands, driving success through data-driven insights, operational excellence, and seamless e-commerce solutions. From global giants to local market leaders, our partners trust Compas.co.id to empower their e-commerce growth.       50+ Brands... Collaborating for Success: Partnerships That Drive Impact At Compas.co.id, we believe in the power of collaboration. From engaging with trusted media partners and influential KOLs to hosting impactful online and offline events, our partnerships fuel innovation and success. Explore our journey of collaboration through award ceremonies, industry panels, and joint initiatives that elevate Indonesia’s FMCG brands.  Inspiring Conversations, Leading Insights From industry panels to keynote speeches, we share expertise and insights that drive the e-commerce industry forward.  Showcasing Our Expertise with Trusted KOLs We collaborate with influential Key Opinion Leaders to highlight our capabilities and build social proof. These partnerships demonstrate the impact of our data-driven solutions and solidify our credibility in the e-commerce landscape  Amplifying Stories with Trusted Media Partners Our partnerships with leading media outlets ensure that the voices of FMCG brands are heard. Let’s work together to create impactful campaigns and share stories that matter  Celebrating Excellence with Strategic Partners Join forces with us to organize prestigious awards that recognize and honor outstanding achievements in e-commerce. Together, we highlight brands driving innovation and growth. Collaborate With Us Amplifying Success with Trusted Media Partners Our collaboration with leading media outlets strengthens our mission to empower FMCG brands with actionable insights and impactful campaigns. Together, we drive meaningful conversations and elevate e-commerce excellence across Indonesia.    Empowering Brands Through Video Insights Discover how Compas.co.id’s video content breaks down complex data into actionable insights, helping FMCG brands achieve measurable e-commerce success. Selamat datang di episode pertama COD by ... Compas.co.id! 
“Apakah saat ini waktu yang tepat untuk masuk ke e-commerce?” “Seberapa potensial market e-commerce di Indonesia?” COD Episode 1 akan menyajikan data untuk menjawab pertanyaan diatas yang seringkali ditanyakan para FMCG Business Leader! Mari bedah potensi market FMCG bersama Compas.co.id!
🔎 Mengenal "e-COD" Sebuah program yang dipandu oleh CEO & Co-founder Compas.co.id, Hanindia Narendrata yang akan memberikan berbagai insight untuk membantu para pelaku bisnis FMCG bersaing secara cerdas dan berbasis data di e-commerce. 
